      "title": "webhdfs",
      "text": "%pyspark\nimport hdfs\n\nclient \u003d hdfs.InsecureClient(\"http://namenode:9870\", user\u003d\"hadoop\")\nclient.makedirs(\"/user/admin\")\nprint(\"listado:\", client.list(\"/user/admin\"))",
